<title>USA: U.S. hog and cattle slaughter estimates - trade.</title>
<headline>U.S. hog and cattle slaughter estimates - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Livestock analysts estimated Wednesday's hog slaughter from 355,000 to 361,000 head versus 359,000 a week ago and 354,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>Cattle slaughter estimates ranged from 129,000 to 131,000 head versus 123,000 a week ago and 130,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>((Jerry Bieszk 312-408-8725))</p>
</text>
